/499298329_1587738532442603_7989255664893447972_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EXybifD-kzsQ7kNvwGr7Xy8&_nc_oc=AdpNyuveAaqLUaxZ0aqalAc94Ft_YqFSgVJ72vnuNx5cMM56uYOFosblV57kkpK5mFo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0L6Mtw46Z5ivdChuWEizvaJva6TEMM1cPSg04bnWVKPA&oe=69F1F011"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ReelCoverArt.png", "id": "26331318676464896", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310817_26331318679798229_3163663610629890871_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GHMfVqdWHhoQ7kNvwG3yGsN&_nc_oc=Adrtqn1Tt757D6-W5PcrgFcK7qzpfYwBqShL94G62pbhu17VkbZBwZKkI1alTZM5icY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2JICbUSnCTKI_3WAWsT6c1Fi03lxk17lbZg6npGzjRIg&oe=69F20B2C"}, "display_name": "Spacious Places", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Spacious Places offers scenic environments to destress and decompress, surrounded by the beauty and the sounds of nature: \n  - Mountains\n  - Desert\n  - River\n  - Grassland\n  - Forest\n  - Tropics\n  - Jungle\nThe app features an array of virtual instruments that you can play, creating your own virtual sound bath, no musical training required.\n  - Harps\n  - Chimes\n  - Bells\n  - Gong\n  - Congas\n  - Drums\n  - Vibraphone\n  - Xylophones\n  - Handpan\n  - Tank Drum\n  - Kalimba\n  - Balafon\nThe sounds and scenery in these spacious places will transport you to a place of peace, calm and tranquility.", "short_description": "Spacious Places blends music and instruments with beautiful scenery to promote restfulness and improve your wellbeing. Journey through hand-crafted worlds and play along with peaceful songs using a variety of virtual instruments. Relax and take a breath, surrounded by nature's embrace, listen to the healing sounds and escape to spacious places."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://spaciousplaces.ai/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, 